  "description": "Chooses a player's CFB27 archetype (PlayerType) from their historical profile. Rules are evaluated in order and the first whose conditions all hold wins; otherwise the position's default is used. Conditions read season stats by canonical name, or WeightPounds / HeightInches / FortyYardDash. A condition whose field is missing from the player's evidence never matches, so a player with no data falls through to the default. Thresholds were derived from the attribute medians of each real archetype in a base dynasty export. Changing PlayerType changes which of EA's overall formulas applies, so the generator always recomputes OverallRating after selecting an archetype.",
